<title>NORWAY: FORECAST - Statistics Norway sees '97 GDP at 3.1 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Statistics Norway sees '97 GDP at 3.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway on Thursday revised forecasts for economic indicators in a quarterly report as follows.</p>
<p>				    (growth rates in pct unless stated):</p>
<p>				 (February forecast) (December forecast)</p>
<p>				     1997    1998	  1997    1998</p>
<p> GDP				  3.1     3.0	   3.0     2.6</p>
<p> GDP mainland		     2.7     2.7	   2.7     2.3</p>
<p> CPI				  1.8     1.2	   2.3     1.8</p>
<p> Export			     5.0     4.0	   4.5     4.8</p>
<p> Import			     6.5     3.4	   4.3     3.5</p>
<p> Jobless rate		     4.5     4.3	   4.0     3.9</p>
<p> C/A surplus (bln NOK)	 73.9    76.5	  71.2    78.4</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
